# Motorola US

> Motorola US is the official United States website for Motorola smartphones, foldable phones, accessories, Moto AI experiences, connected devices, business solutions, customer support, company information, and legal resources.

Motorola designs and delivers smartphones, accessories, software, and connected-device experiences that help people discover, share, and connect with the world around them. Since 1928, Motorola has focused on purposeful innovation by combining advanced technology with intuitive user experiences.

